DexSwapModuleL2SequencerFork (Base mainnet)
├── when deployed against Base's real SwapRouter02 and sequencer uptime feed
│   ├── it should set the router
│   ├── it should set the sequencer uptime feed
│   └── it should set the sequencer grace period
├── when reading the live sequencer feed
│   └── it should report startedAt and updatedAt far apart
├── when the grace period sits between the two timestamps
│   └── it should measure the grace period from startedAt
├── when the grace period has not elapsed
│   ├── it should reject the swap with oracle price unavailable
│   ├── it should estimate zero output
│   └── it should not move any tokens through executeAction
└── when the sequencer is up past the grace period
    └── it should swap through the real Uniswap V3 pool above the oracle floor
